1\u062a \u0644\u0647 \u0625\u0644\u0627 \u0645\u0631\u062a\u064a\u0646", "claim_ids": ["c1", "c2", "c3"], "image_query": "Al-Ahli Saudi team", "image": {"provider": "commons", "asset_id": "198256711", "title": "File:Al-Ahli.Squad.2026-27.jpg", "description": "Al-Ahli Squad for season 2026-27", "download_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Al-Ahli.Squad.2026-27.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Al-Ahli.Squad.2026-27.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Al-Ahli.Squad.2026-27.jpg", "credit": "OmarZi64", "credit_line": "Own work", "license": "CC BY 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0", "attribution_required": "true", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "2026-08-27 12:17:09", "width": 1600, "height": 955, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "9a72e4ce215f7cf792033b68432804397c19e8843d7bfcd9840f85c6080db65a"}}, {"kind": "story", "title": "\u0645\u0646 \u0645\u0624\u0633\u0633\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0648\u0631\u064a... \u064851 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0631\u0627\u0629 \u0628\u0644\u0627 \u062e\u0633\u0627\u0631\u0629", "body": "\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0647\u0644\u064a \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f \u0645\u0646 \u0623\u0631\u0628\u0639\u0629 \u0623\u0646\u062f\u064a\u0629 \u0623\u0633\u0633\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0648\u0631\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0639\u0648\u062f\u064a \u0644\u0644\u0645\u062d\u062a\u0631\u0641\u064a\u0646\u060c \u0648\u0628\u0642\u064a \u0641\u064a \u062f\u0648\u0631\u064a \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0636\u0648\u0627\u0621 \u0628\u062f\u0648\u0646 \u0647\u0628\u0648\u0637 \u062d\u062a\u0649 \u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645 2021-2022. \u0648\u0641\u064a \u0633\u062c\u0644\u0647 \u0631\u0642\u0645 \u0623\u0637\u0648\u0644 \u0633\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0629 \u0628\u0644\u0627 \u062e\u0633\u0627\u0631\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u062f\u0648\u0631\u064a: 51 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0631\u0627\u0629 \u0628\u064a\u0646 2014 \u06482016\u060c \u0648\u064a\u0644\u0639\u0628 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0631\u064a\u0627\u062a\u0647 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0645\u062f\u064a\u0646\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0644\u0643 \u0639\u0628\u062f\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u064a\u0627\u0636\u064a\u0629.", "punch": "", "claim_ids": ["c4", "c5"], "image_query": "King Abdullah Sports City", "image": {"provider": "commons", "asset_id": "192181864", "title": "File:Ziyad Al-Johani.jpg", "description": "Ziyad Mubarak Eid Al-Marwani Al-Johani (Arabic: \u0632\u064a\u0627\u062f \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0631\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0648\u0627\u0646\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0647\u0646\u064a; born 11 November 2001) is a Saudi Arabian professional footballer who plays as a midfielder for Al-Ahli and the Saudi Arabia national team.", "download_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/Ziyad_Al-Johani.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/Ziyad_Al-Johani.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ziyad_Al-Johani.jpg", "credit": "OmarZi64", "credit_line": "Own work", "license": "CC BY 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0", "attribution_required": "true", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "2026-05-17", "width": 879, "height": 1165, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "7fb8e841e443ba16c5cc0383e3c353dd4d7b8d369790d9b175d754c1eec951f1"}}, {"kind": "story", "title": "\u0633\u062c\u0644 \u062e\u0627\u0631\u062c\u064a \u0643\u0628\u064a\u0631 \u0648\u0641\u0631\u064a\u0642 \u062a\u063a\u064a\u0631\u062a \u0645\u0644\u0627\u0645\u062d\u0647", "body": "\u062e\u0627\u0631\u062c \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0639\u0648\u062f\u064a\u0629 \u064a\u062d\u0645\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0647\u0644\u064a \u0641\u064a \u0633\u062c\u0644\u0647 \u0643\u0627\u0645\u0644 \u0644\u0642\u0628\u064a\u0646 \u0641\u064a \u062f\u0648\u0631\u064a \u0623\u0628\u0637\u0627\u0644 \u0622\u0633\u064a\u0627 \u0644\u0644\u0646\u062e\u0628\u0629\u060c \u0648\u062b\u0644\u0627\u062b \u0628\u0637\u0648\u0644\u0627\u062a \u062e\u0644\u064a\u062c\u064a\u0629 \u0644\u0644\u0623\u0646\u062f\u064a\u0629\u060c \u0648\u0628\u0637\u0648\u0644\u0629 \u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629. \u0623\u0645\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u0627\u0644\u064a\u0629 \u0641\u062a\u063a\u064a\u0631\u062a: \u0631\u062d\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062f\u0631\u0628 \u064a\u0627\u064a\u0633\u0644\u0647\u060c \u0648\u063a\u0627\u062f\u0631 \u0631\u064a\u0627\u0636 \u0645\u062d\u0631\u0632 \u0648\u0641\u0631\u0627\u0646\u0643 \u0643\u064a\u0633\u064a\u0647\u060c \u0648\u062c\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u0647\u0648\u0644\u0646\u062f\u064a \u0628\u0648\u0634\u064a\u062a\u0634 \u0628\u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639 \u062c\u062f\u064a\u062f.", "punch": "\u0648\u0641\u064a \u0643\u0623\u0633 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u062a\u062c\u0627\u0648\u0632 \u0623\u0648\u0643\u0644\u0627\u0646\u062f \u062b\u0645 \u062e\u0633\u0631 1-2 \u0623\u0645\u0627\u0645 \u0645\u0627\u0645\u064a\u0644\u0648\u062f\u064a \u0635\u0646 \u062f\u0627\u0648\u0646\u0632", "claim_ids": ["c6", "c8", "c7"], "image_query": "Al-Ahli fans stands", "image": {"provider": "commons", "asset_id": "192181863", "title": "File:Merih Demiral 2026.jpg", "description": "Merih Demiral (born 5 March 1998) is a Turkish professional footballer who plays as a centre-back for Saudi Pro League club Al-Ahli and Turkey national team.", "download_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/Merih_Demiral_2026.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/Merih_Demiral_2026.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Merih_Demiral_2026.jpg", "credit": "OmarZi64", "credit_line": "Own work", "license": "CC BY 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0", "attribution_required": "true", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "2026-05-17", "width": 1059, "height": 1317, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "eb021a9345163a6edd45c176ec5060ec897a88d7d6ac1000511efa9dfc866511"}}, {"kind": "credits", "title": "\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0635\u0627\u062f\u0631 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0635\u0648\u0631", "body": "Editorial sources and photo attribution", "image": {"provider": "commons", "asset_id": "198256711", "title": "File:Al-Ahli.Squad.2026-27.jpg", "description": "Al-Ahli Squad for season 2026-27", "download_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Al-Ahli.Squad.2026-27.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled", "original_url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Al-Ahli.Squad.2026-27.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original", "source_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Al-Ahli.Squad.2026-27.jpg", "credit": "OmarZi64", "credit_line": "Own work", "license": "CC BY 4.0", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0", "attribution_required": "true", "restrictions": "", "date_created": "2026-08-27 12:17:09", "width": 1600, "height": 955, "licensing_verified": false, "sha256": "9a72e4ce215f7cf792033b68432804397c19e8843d7bfcd9840f85c6080db65a"}}]}, "feedback": "editorial_review_rejected: Timing and facts check out: the aawsat piece of 19 Sep 2026 carries substantive current coverage (1-2 loss to Mamelodi Sundowns after passing Auckland, Jaissle/Mahrez/Kessi\u00e9 out, Bosic in), and the earlier factual fix is done \u2014 card 3 now presents the 2 ACL Elite + 3 Gulf + 1 Arab titles as the club's overall international tally, matching Wikipedia. Founding 1937, Jeddah, Pro League founding member, no relegation until 2021-22, the 51-match unbeaten run 2014-2016 and the 1978/2016 doubles all match the sources. Counters read 1 \u0645\u0646 2 then 2 \u0645\u0646 2 in correct order; light background and Almarai identity intact; Arabic is clean with no clipping or overlap.\n\nVISUALS (must fix): Card 1 shows the full Al-Ahli starting XI in green/white kit lined up on the pitch before a green-and-white tifo \u2014 clearly relevant. Card 2 shows a close head-and-shoulders portrait of a young bearded player in a black Adidas training top with the green club crest, orange/yellow stadium seats behind. Card 3 shows another single player (waist-up, No. 28) in the SAME black Adidas training top with the same crest, in front of the same style of stadium seating. Cards 2 and 3 are visually interchangeable subject shots \u2014 same kit, same setting, same framing \u2014 so visual_variety fails. In addition, the credits banner is a crop of the card 1 squad photo, repeating an already-used image. Replace card 3 (or card 2) with a visibly different Al-Ahli image \u2014 crowd/tifo, King Abdullah Sports City exterior, a celebration or match action \u2014 or reduce to fewer cards, and give the credits banner a non-repeated crop.\n\nWording nit while you are in there: \"\u064a\u062d\u0645\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0647\u0644\u064a \u0641\u064a \u0633\u062c\u0644\u0647 \u0643\u0627\u0645\u0644 \u0644\u0642\u0628\u064a\u0646 \u0641\u064a \u062f\u0648\u0631\u064a \u0623\u0628\u0637\u0627\u0644 \u0622\u0633\u064a\u0627 \u0644\u0644\u0646\u062e\u0628\u0629\" reads garbled; simplify to \"\u0641\u064a \u0633\u062c\u0644\u0647 \u0644\u0642\u0628\u0627\u0646 \u0641\u064a \u062f\u0648\u0631\u064a \u0623\u0628\u0637\u0627\u0644 \u0622\u0633\u064a\u0627 \u0644\u0644\u0646\u062e\u0628\u0629\"."}